1
00:00:00,961 --> 00:00:04,551
You went in my...? Why would...?
What are you saying?

2
00:00:04,715 --> 00:00:07,095
(Penny:)Not a big deal.
I was making coffee and ran out of milk.

3
00:00:07,259 --> 00:00:09,849
(Sheldon:)You're the milk thief.

4
00:00:11,639 --> 00:00:15,599
(Sheldon:)Leonard said I was crazy,
but I knew that carton felt lighter.

5
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:18,940
All right, Sheldon, calm down.
I'll call the building manager.

6
00:00:19,104 --> 00:00:21,984
(Penny:)He'll come open your door.
Just eat here while you're waiting.

7
00:00:22,149 --> 00:00:25,489
Eat my dinner in your apartment?

8
00:00:25,653 --> 00:00:28,533
- Yeah, why not?
- Sure, why not?

9
00:00:28,697 --> 00:00:31,327
(Sheldon:)And after the sun's down,
we can all pile in my pickup...

10
00:00:31,492 --> 00:00:33,782
(Sheldon:)...and go skinny-dipping
down at the crick.

11
00:00:35,287 --> 00:00:38,287
Because today's the day
that stopped making sense.

12
00:00:42,753 --> 00:00:44,793
- Thanks.
- I'm telling you, Leonard.

13
00:00:44,964 --> 00:00:49,214
Video slots, free drinks brought to us
by a bosomy barmaid...

14
00:00:49,385 --> 00:00:51,515
...and all-you-can-eat shrimp for 3.95?

15
00:00:53,180 --> 00:00:58,020
(Raj:)Disneyland can suck it.

